        "items": [
          {
            "id": "easy-share-trend",
            "tone": "watch",
            "claim": "54% of Mar's run time was in Z1–Z2, with no clear trend.",
            "detail": "Time in Z1–Z2 as a share of all run time, by month: Sep 65%, Oct 66%, Nov 66%, Dec 66%, Jan 66%, Feb 62%, Mar 54%. Month to month the line has no direction the data will support — the level is the thing to read, not the slope. The 80/20 model wants 80 here, and 54% is a long way from it — which is a statement about where the hours go, not about whether the hard sessions are wrong. Two short hard runs plus one genuinely easy half-hour lands near 60% on its own.",
            "basis": "7 months with at least 10 minutes of run time · 2025-09 → 2026-03",
